{"title":"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 25","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Palindrome\" title=\"Palindrome\">palindrome</a></b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Whole_number\" title=\"Whole number\">whole number</a> that reads the same forwards and backwards.  If one neglects the colon, certain times displayed on a digital watch are palindromes.  Three examples are: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/c/f8c8fdc89909529b49703114d563e5498526a68b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{1:01}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"23\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/b/cabc2a651698543809140256958b12f7c2c9cf2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{4:44}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"23\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/6/af69f9ca56fa19b84c4b31b42d61606d8575ba85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{12:21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"65\" height=\"25\" />.  How many times during a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />-hour period will be palindromes?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a95f8b36272bbe5c3e44cf6ab92dc83c12bbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 57 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 60 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 63 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 90 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 93$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"375\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider two cases:\n</p><p>Case 1: the hour is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or less.  In this case, the time has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> digits, so it is in the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/f/69f0e84a198612e031c1a924afefe50fc56ab427.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A:BA$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"14\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> can be any digit from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> while <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> can be any digit from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/b/f9b8251dc3c39f06c01759c29bd9075c197fbfbc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9\\cdot 6 = 54$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"76\" height=\"14\" /> three-digit palindromes.\n</p><p>Case 2: the hour is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> or more.  In this case, the time has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> digits, so it is in the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/1/7f14990013ec706489fb337c5770a7a661d3b0e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB:BA$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"14\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> can be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> four-digit palindromes.\n</p><p>Therefore, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/6/226d6aa2f08d540dfa5f48c3cee425cbbc084f43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$54 + 3 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 57}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"140\" height=\"30\" /> total palindromes.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME\" title=\"1988 AJHSME\">1988 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1988\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last<br />Problem</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1988 AJHSME 